msgstr "Recompile teu núcleo e reinicialize no novo núcleo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/lm_sensors.xml:128
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Lm_sensors"
msgstr "Instalação do \"Lm_sensors\""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/lm_sensors.xml:131
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Lm_sensors</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>Lm_sensors</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#.  <screen>
#. <userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../lm_sensors-&lm_sensors-
#. version;-upstream_fixes-1.patch &amp;&amp;
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/lm_sensors.xml:136
#, no-wrap, xml-text
#| msgid ""
#| "<userinput>make PREFIX=/usr        \\\n"
#| "     BUILD_STATIC_LIB=0 \\\n"
#| "     MANDIR=/usr/share/man</userinput>"
msgid ""
"<userinput>make PREFIX=/usr           \\\n"
"     BUILD_STATIC_LIB=0    \\\n"
"     MANDIR=/usr/share/man \\\n"
"     EXLDFLAGS=</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make PREFIX=/usr           \\\n"
"     BUILD_STATIC_LIB=0    \\\n"
"     MANDIR=/usr/share/man \\\n"
"     EXLDFLAGS=</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/lm_sensors.xml:142
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/lm_sensors.xml:146
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/lm_sensors.xml:149
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make PREFIX=/usr        \\\n"
"     BUILD_STATIC_LIB=0 \\\n"
"     MANDIR=/usr/share/man install &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m755 -d /usr/share/doc/lm_sensors-&lm-sensors-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -rv              README INSTALL doc/* \\\n"
"                    /usr/share/doc/lm_sensors-&lm-sensors-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make PREFIX=/usr       \\\n"
"     BUILD_STATIC_LIB=0 \\\n"
"     MANDIR=/usr/share/man install &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m755 -d /usr/share/doc/lm_sensors-&lm-sensors-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -rv              README INSTALL doc/* \\\n"
"                    /usr/share/doc/lm_sensors-&lm-sensors-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/lm_sensors.xml:159
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/lm_sensors.xml:162
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>BUILD_STATIC_LIB=0</parameter>: This parameter disables compiling"
" and installing the static version of <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">libsensors</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>BUILD_STATIC_LIB=0</parameter>: Esse parâmetro desabilita a "
"compilação e instalação da versão estática da <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">libsensors</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/lm_sensors.xml:168
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>EXLDFLAGS=</parameter>: This parameter disables hard coding "
"library search paths (rpath) into the binary executable files and shared "
"libraries.  This package does not need rpath for an installation into the "
"standard location, and rpath may sometimes cause unwanted effects or even "
"security issues."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>EXLDFLAGS=</parameter>: Esse parâmetro desabilita codificar "
"rigidamente caminhos de pesquisa de biblioteca (rpath) nos arquivos binários"
" executáveis e bibliotecas compartilhadas. Esse pacote não precisa do rpath "
"para uma instalação no local padrão, e o rpath às vezes pode causar efeitos "
"indesejados ou até mesmo problemas de segurança."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/lm_sensors.xml:176
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>PROG_EXTRA=sensord</option>: This parameter enables compiling "
"<command>sensord</command>, a daemon that can monitor your system at regular"
" intervals. Compiling <command>sensord</command> requires <ulink "
"url=\"https://oss.oetiker.ch/rrdtool/\">RRDtool</ulink>. Be sure to install "
"RRDtool in <filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename> by running "
"<command>make prefix=/usr</command> when building it.  Otherwise, Lm_sensors"
" will not find it easily."
msgstr ""
"<option>PROG_EXTRA=sensord</option>: Esse parâmetro habilita compilar o "
"<command>sensord</command>, um processo de segundo plano que consegue "
"monitorar seu sistema em intervalos regulares. Compilar o "
"<command>sensord</command> exige <ulink "
"url=\"https://oss.oetiker.ch/rrdtool/\">RRDtool</ulink>. Certifique-se de "
"instalar o \"RRDtool\" em <filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename> "
"executando <command>make prefix=/usr</command> ao construí-lo. Caso "
"contrário, \"Lm_sensors\" não o encontrará facilmente."

